{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t深水埗運動場對開的一個地盤，發現可疑物品，爆炸品處理課到場調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n中午近1時，警方接獲地盤職員報案，指發現可疑物品。爆炸品處理課到深水埗運動場對開的一個地盤調查，發現一個大約200毫米長，60毫米闊的可疑物品。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.726995+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:28:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:25.576147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:26.583740+00:00","content_hash":"2b1877a24d10e6853a91be878c3b65f1387fa9070199ee15e613f1613f351786","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}